    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d8a7dc72995a4701b0d427",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望藉由这一战掌握某种契机……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "853f67d61e851c5780d154eb5ff87c1f9df809547d6732e957029a9625495b13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05fc8af6aa00c0aeb1931006",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够掌握重要的1胜吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3d148d95510455fa64ba4881620cb48535fe876f3920a83a575dba35450663",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8acbc7bfec72d0dce3241a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就此期待局势逆转吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e28d1c4319cc172aa0ffd4ad1acf8a20043ef56a4d4cd4d0228953b7be8a004",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:187ff0d8d6bb43b33c24f822",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能将这场竞赛化为转机吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "27be29a33d9512f291bae0c2940ea5f619135c8e35ce91d53f2fec0d1ae5868a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "10203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe76b569e99f0883aa536e21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过，在累积经验后已能窥见胜机了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b7ae18171e2bdb3b6a3aba5248105766ad8281bdee802ac970d6868eb3bfb0f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:546fa079b21e7855f5b702c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去5战中获得1胜的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1747aab19cba4a2e5dc492315baac0adeaccfce8a3a5be254b191202acd142e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383f951d1ee2dd30f0d656fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<trainer_name>」</color>的招牌赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d57121301d91b9a363529767d53c6f419821c720caeb8685cef3e74c90058a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa6c7ca31f8b7a5f09a310e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "登上决赛也充满自信，值得关注的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e72890cc29a6bd6b618906e0b5e657a89aebcf5124102d73c4288ee5eefcce08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81922a3e23dc11aa97e57014",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "瞩目的赛马娘，终于来到了这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82cf805b23682aceb4b88e6786db4b67e58bc89e976a007454ab5ee95a1cf74f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:533c398bfcae187e55acc2de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛的胜率为20%的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a30fce3241611103021ef98f2a1cfe0fd92e3fa23d54c487429b3c940febcc9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64154856a246599347ed3fcc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尝过胜利滋味的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "598dcb776890d11f2d8a90ea5fce6a7a23b2dbc182ba4caec811f9e8a3b88cc8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5e53d4fd6b0ef0e6401b234",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一直在等待爆发之时吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "833269d83b38de658b10441120e657b67a3a4d81cf0c213cffdad831bdcf8df1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d019f5638fef38e16932dd6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若能在这个盛大舞台发挥坚强的实力，获得优胜并非只是梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "259607c037da502adbc24013475a0badf24a6702017ff72655f358c304734a56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b417b8ab7fd249ccf91aa4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛时究竟会让我们见识到怎么样的表现呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5422f38344bc5d450df243837ff7e2f1d86b4e253bc753c95305564d9684093",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a64e206278b48c7a7a1338",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若能将竞赛导向擅长的情况，就能大幅度地接近胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f03905cc1ad0012df174a5db17c72991d3c7e03af439dd704118edae03db40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cecc8441f5f2ddf86f53ab7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "展现了在上次竞赛中掌握到的重要灵感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4783637c5d34a76713c44f2e200b3aa1d2991d8173e1a00be382c0ae2de510e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66802f6e70508e7691970a97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "登上迈向荣耀的阶梯吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7fe8a0356c2e7f0fd940ceb6adffa8d59d75c574a6f11ffdeae6e8793030baf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19588ce283dabe02e46fed80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "踏出奔向优胜的一步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6f617d273403a2e8f71f92c02101c6165ef79b01edb1ea0fe68a0c133d0cd4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d623a137f0fb3068566db88",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "前往最后的盛大竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "449f7a480ada7f433ced8239fbfcc78bab8eeb69783113c6ce8cabe8a2b840bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "110202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:947a587f136132369c6f7d05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但本次竞赛似乎不同。是因为萌生对第1名的执着吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "684d0e7722c5173299f8213ab9217e404148e075fad50e87f199ef5ed36122e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe4a5b167b57ee50c579ffc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过成为殿堂赛马娘前在<single_battle_record>留有成绩，实力无庸置疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beb60fa593e705f398fc4f97af1b3caa649825fd40b3db355a7457c1ef0c03c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:214fa3a4a2d1fe543237384b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过那压倒性的速度，让人不禁感受到胜利的迹象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8236a7fc1e7d5bbace2236814c83d953ccf9bcb0409eda4c6930fc880f394fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f853a0500704e4b687df594",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但其无尽的持久力，能期待持续跑到后期也不会力竭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd466982c73092aa873b1445ef0fcc0f8a760bf5f7236957f0e6f4ceb0fc5215",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a3dd81ef6c3378309be9163",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过爆发性的力量是其强项，其实力货真价实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b47d19b6885c5eca3581fc97635d07efca90cd5b155709434ebe6b9c8385f925",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae0d247f98f606e1e61fe01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但与生俱来那不屈的意志力，会随着情势大展所长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c26fe12f4b935c0047c614e1e709dd77a8aed0f5972cf6ac32ca0d9049aef6c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6038208fbc498e8198a29d73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不过若是竞赛的展开符合她的精心计算，期待度会大大提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e810bdf3405c7d04004884759895381b6089b667d74f9af04a621ea327fbd68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5154ac2bb48e024da1d119c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若能合力累积胜利，通往决赛的道路会为她们敞开吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c47e119f1d428653c06039e7821f433c62d2b02bf76fe199295bb23d893b3b60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec8f233be9e6e76881ee86b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "似乎已经掌握了攻略这次大赛的线索。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d8a0de40802e6e2a1a99736b601d17c4be8be508ec8c456d28f953b5fddce4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b125842977a8deb8fe69bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当竞赛按照预定进行时，会展现出惊人的破坏力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1955f4914e899968cf18aa70ca369e3892b81020c2c8d1f96796bdb77e6db708",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46979d0d18ec881f75669a84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也能引领这场竞赛吗？一定要看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33a4341ea450e5b0e9851b0e4d21444d68bb9a5ad099d256a476cf7928851b9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3771c3e51915a574b56e920",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在这场竞赛中也让人感受到胜利眷顾的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e0322bf7ff481d5bb5849d8cfc3e30a569c905f35176415298439038db49f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0496d3d96896ae478781998d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也期待她这一战的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4557d507586ce4150217bbd830f2d816774b0f1087931ad27a33d89e4e0796c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4949c9fd5f284b09c76d827",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关注其压倒性的速度吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "592cad9fca31488b793b4477d11d698dbe5421e113de431e8538f07bd4d5c85e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab5bd2180fd46cf15fe5a66b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关注其压倒性的耐力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c41d5186e95d529f13be1fed0ac17a7109e615d8fcda9d308a05a874cb0ef8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11204"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
